<section class="registration-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="two-column">
            <div class="column">
                <h2>Registration Information</h2>
                <p>Join us for three days of learning, networking, and collaboration at IndabaX Botswana 2026. Registration includes:</p>
                <ul class="registration-benefits">
                    <li>Access to all conference sessions and workshops</li>
                    <li>Conference materials and resources</li>
                    <li>Lunch and refreshments during the event</li>
                    <li>Certificate of participation</li>
                    <li>Networking opportunities with speakers and attendees</li>
                </ul>
                
                <div class="registration-types">
                    <h3>Registration Types</h3>
                    <div class="registration-type">
                        <h4>Student</h4>
                        <p class="price">P300</p>
                        <p>For full-time students with valid student ID</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="registration-type">
                        <h4>Academic</h4>
                        <p class="price">P600</p>
                        <p>For faculty and researchers from academic institutions</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="registration-type">
                        <h4>Industry</h4>
                        <p class="price">P1,200</p>
                        <p>For professionals from industry and government</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="important-dates">
                    <h3>Important Dates</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Early Bird Registration Deadline: March 31, 2026</li>
                        <li>Regular Registration Deadline: May 31, 2026</li>
                        <li>Late Registration: June 1–10, 2026 (additional fee applies)</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="column">
                <div class="apps-soon-card">
                    <i class="fas fa-hourglass-half cs-icon"></i>
                    <h2>Applications Opening Soon</h2>
                    <p>Registration for IndabaX Botswana 2026 is not yet open. We'll launch applications in early 2026 — watch this space!</p>
                    <ul class="apps-soon-dates">
                        <li>Early Bird Deadline: March 31, 2026</li>
                        <li>Regular Deadline: May 31, 2026</li>
                        <li>Late Registration: June 1–10, 2026</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="cs-notify">Get notified when registration opens:<br>
                        <a href="mailto:info@indabaxbotswana.org">info@indabaxbotswana.org</a>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
