</section>

<section class="faq-section">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <div class="faq-grid">
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>Is there financial support available for students?</h3>
                <p>Yes, we offer a limited number of scholarships for students. Please email <a href="mailto:scholarships@indabaxbotswana.org">scholarships@indabaxbotswana.org</a> for more information.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>Can I register for specific days only?</h3>
                <p>Yes, single-day registrations are available. Please contact us for pricing and availability.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>What is the cancellation policy?</h3>
                <p>Cancellations made before May 15, 2026 will receive a full refund minus a P100 processing fee. No refunds will be issued after this date.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>Will the presentations be recorded?</h3>
                <p>Yes, most sessions will be recorded and made available to registered participants after the event.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
